Third-party data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

web/data/abbreve.json (and the copy bundled in the Python package as
trendy_cli/data/abbreve.json) is derived from Abbreve:

  Abbreve — an open-source dictionary for slang and abbreviations
  https://github.com/Njong392/Abbreve
  Copyright 2022 Njong Emy
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  (full text: web/data/ABBREVE-LICENSE, or
  http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)

Modifications made by Trendy: the original per-term files were converted to a
single JSON list, normalised (lower-cased terms, URL-decoded names such as
"s/o"), de-duplicated, and annotated with optional age-band ("age") fields.
Definitions are otherwise unchanged. The Abbreve data remains under
Apache-2.0; the MIT license of Trendy does not apply to it.
